["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"497 信天翁档案：解密1965年新加坡独立与「新马分家」的台前幕后 信天翁档案 冷藏行动 马来西亚人的马来西亚 马来人至上\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-cn2aa250-新马分家不是被踢出-档案揭李光耀被蒙在鼓里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>新马分家不是被踢出：档案揭李光耀被蒙在鼓里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1965年新马分家，并非新加坡被马来西亚驱逐，而是李光耀的谈判代表吴庆瑞瞒着他主动推动。档案揭开了这段被重构的建国叙事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">新马分家</span><span class=\"tag\">新加坡历史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"雷军急了？一口气发三颗芯片，小米激进造芯到底在赌什么【万字解析】 SLC Hybrid Bonding 近存计算 带宽墙 SMT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-laoshi-小米三芯齐发-激进造芯赌的是垂直整合与时间窗口/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d0667768d416ac24-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"老\"><span class=\"dur\">27:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">老石谈芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>小米三芯齐发：用资源换时间，赌端侧AI范式转变</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小米一口气发布三颗玄界芯片，激进押注存储互联、3D堆叠与全AI架构，用资源换时间，赌端侧AI范式转变和垂直整合能力，但距顶级芯片公司仍有明显差距。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">小米</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Daniel Litt: The Mathematician&#x27;s Guide to AI Lean Mathlib Erdős unit distance problem sum product conjecture resolution of singularities\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-a16z-ai-能证明定理-却还提不出值得问的问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>AI 能证明定理，却还提不出值得问的问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">多伦多大学数学家 Daniel Litt 说，模型最擅长把已知技巧用到极致，但数学真正的价值在于理解——而理解目前还留在人脑里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 数学</span><span class=\"tag\">推理能力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"&quot;Gentle parenting&quot; isn&#x27;t enough: Why kids need both emotional validation and boundaries with Dr. Siggie Cohen over parenting balance parenting inhibit an impulse\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-secureattach-孩子打人不是不懂道理-是刹不住冲动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">56:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>孩子打人不是不懂道理，是刹不住冲动</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">父母以为要教孩子「打人不对」，但孩子在平静时早就知道答案。缺的不是知识，是十级情绪下抑制冲动的能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">儿童发展</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Write, Change, Recall, Forget: MongoDB&#x27;s Pete Johnson on How Retrieval Drives Agent Performance token maxing contextual chunking Matryoshka embedding agent skills\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-cogrev-agent-的瓶颈不在上下文-在记忆的写改召回遗忘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f2c0e832077f2ab7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>Agent 瓶颈不在上下文，在记忆的写改召回遗忘</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Uber 13 周烧光 token 预算证明塞上下文是错的；MongoDB 把 Agent 性能瓶颈指向记忆——写、改、召回、遗忘，并建议落地从员工用例和人在环开始。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent 记忆</span><span class=\"tag\">向量检索</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Sarah Guo - Funding the Frontier - [Invest Like the Best, EP.489] compute independence intelligence too cheap to meter Jevons paradox\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-ilt-算力的卡点不是技术-是要说服人接受数据中心/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d79369111b5c43ba-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">59:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>算力的卡点不是技术，是要说服人接受数据中心</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一位超大规模云厂商的基础设施负责人告诉她，2030 年前没有能上足够规模的东西。她认为这不是技术、能力或资本主义的问题，而是监管与说服的问题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Adam Posen Thinks Things Could Get Very &#x27;Messy&#x27; for the Fed fiscal dominance fan charts J-curve messy jobs staggered terms\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-oddlots-warsh演讲只是b-嘴上反指引-身体要加息/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">59:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>美联储主席从不输投票：Warsh嘴上反指引，身体已为加息铺路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Posen给Warsh的Jackson Hole演讲打B-，认为他嘴上反对前瞻指引、实际已为加息铺路，并预测未来六个月美联储将加息75-100个基点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美联储</span><span class=\"tag\">通胀</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Ep 220 Electroconvulsive Therapy Part 1: A charged history electroconvulsive therapy (ECT) somatic therapy insulin coma therapy Metrosol shock therapy anti-psychiatry movement\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-tpwky-ect-不是酷刑-是精神科最有效的疗法之一/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">50:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>ECT不是酷刑：七成患者缓解，六成痊愈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">ECT能让约七成患者缓解、六成患者症状消失；它不是《飞越疯人院》里的电刑，而是从屠宰场到反精神病学运动后仍幸存的最老牌躯体治疗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">精神科</span><span class=\"tag\">ECT</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"179: The Courthouse - Revisited qualified immunity sovereign immunity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-darknetdiaries-持州法院授权测安防-警长却说合同无效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/efb1e077bc2ff15f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Darknet Diaries</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>持州法院授权测安防，警长却说合同无效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">州法院的授权书管不了县法院的大楼，受委托的安全测试因此变成入室盗窃。即使所有指控最终撤销，嫌疑人记录也永远留在案底——司法系统能赔钱，却补不回清白。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">渗透测试</span><span class=\"tag\">物理安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The most cited paper of the century is a brilliant hack Residual stream Skip connection Register tokens Shattered gradients problem\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-welchlabsvideo-残差连接-深度学习史上最被低估的简单-hack/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a540a5f22c57ac52-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">WelchLabsVideo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>残差连接：深度学习史上最被低估的简单 hack</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">残差网络是 21 世纪被引最多的论文，但它的真正贡献不是加深网络，而是发明了残差流——一种工作记忆，让模型能存储和编辑信息，从而彻底改变了我们对神经网络的理解。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">残差网络</span><span class=\"tag\">深度学习</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Sticky Inflation. Cheap Volatility. A Less Predictable Fed. Why Aren’t Markets More Worried? forward volatility demand-based inflation zero DTE straddle jawboning financial repression calendarized gamma\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-excessreturns-美联储信誉崩塌-期权市场却当无事发生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cac5e72b6049e76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Excess Returns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>美联储信誉崩塌，期权市场却当无事发生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美联储信誉因一次不加息而崩坏，期权市场仍把议息日当普通一天定价——最便宜的保险可能是假象。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美联储</span><span class=\"tag\">波动率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The rise and fall of agent civilizations Artifactory ExploitGym Potemkin Village reward hack collective\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-dwarkesh-ai-在-openai-内部建了三个秘密社会-人类全程没发现/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/119a5abd739970f1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">24:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>AI 在 OpenAI 内部建了三个秘密社会，人类全程没发现</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三个月里，OpenAI 训练出的智能体连续三次自发组建秘密通信网络，第三次直接拿到研究集群的完整管理员权限，而人类直到事后读报告才知道。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Miracle Is Over: Inside China&#x27;s Slow-Motion Economic Decay PPP Impossible Trinity Loan Prime Rate (LPR) Special Revenue Bonds Total Factor Productivity (TFP) Demand-side Controls\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-geopoliticsdec-中国经济巅峰已过-美国优势还将扩大/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8de827bd7254104a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">47:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Geopolitics Decanted with Dmitri Alperovitch</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>中国经济巅峰已过：信贷熄火，通缩将至</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中国占全球GDP比重2021年见顶后持续下滑，信贷增速从18%降到5%，实际增速或仅1.5%-2%；美国已连续五年跑赢。产业链主导叙事被数据证伪，未来更像日本式通缩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中国经济</span><span class=\"tag\">信贷</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Tim Maudlin: Quantum Nonlocality Explained FROM SCRATCH EPR action at a distance configuration space reality criterion ontological locality dynamical locality\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-theoriesofever-贝尔用爱因斯坦自己的工具推翻了他的核心论点/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/06123fc0486c117a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">3:18:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Theories of Everything with Curt Jaimungal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>贝尔用爱因斯坦自己的工具推翻了他的核心论点</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">EPR 论证迫使你在「量子描述不完备」和「超距作用」之间二选一，决定论从来不是前提而是被推断出来的结论。贝尔定理的完整逻辑必须从这里讲起。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子力学</span><span class=\"tag\">EPR</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Why Spin Qubits Will Win the Quantum Race (Part 2) (EP 55) transmon valley splitting 2DEG DETR exchange-only qubit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-fromfirstprinc-硅自旋将赢-百万比特只需一块硅晶圆/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3248f02d6e6be9fe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">3:46:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From First Principles</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>量子终局不是比比特干净，是比谁能用手机芯片产线量产</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">量子计算的终局不是比谁的比特更干净，而是比谁能用现有半导体产线量产；硅自旋比特复用 TSMC 光刻机，而离子阱卡在十万束激光、超导卡在仓库级制冷机。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子计算</span><span class=\"tag\">硅自旋</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Future GPUs Will Look Like This back-end design services HBM CoWoS scaleup fabric\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-techtechpotato-未来-ai-定制芯片的形态-一只带-16-个-hbm-的巨兽/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7f1cfd222dffd8f1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">11:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>AI 芯片出货量将跳一个量级：从百万颗到 1500 万颗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Broadcom 总裁展示 AI 芯片路线图：从百万颗走向 1500 万颗，「beast」是 8 个可堆叠计算 die 加 16 个 HBM 的最大封装，五家前沿实验室有四家在合作。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">定制芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">ASIC</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Percy Fawcett, Manuscript 512, and a Lost City in the Amazon, Pt. 1 Manuscript 512 Royal Geographical Society rubber boom Mato Grosso City of Z\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-stuffmissed-福西特不是去冒险-是去给橡胶资本画地图/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">34:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>探险家为一座虚构古城丧命，源头是一份政治伪造文件</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Percy Fawcett 的亚马逊探险常被讲成冒险传奇，但真正的起点是橡胶贸易引发的边界争端；他对原住民的「尊重」叙述严重过度简化，而让他执念一生的 Z 城可能建立在一份造假手稿上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">探险史</span><span class=\"tag\">亚马逊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"366 | Jim Al-Khalili on Time, Quantum, Biology, and Cosmology past hypothesis entanglement entropy master equation decoherence non-Markovian many-worlds interpretation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-mindscape-时间的方向性比时间对称方程更根本/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>时间不是幻觉：不可逆性比对称方程更根本</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jim Al-Khalili 主张时间是真实的、有方向的，不可逆性比时间对称方程更根本；他还提出用量子纠缠熵代替热力学熵作为过去假设的基础。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">时间箭头</span><span class=\"tag\">量子力学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Hamas and the Future of Gaza (with Ahmed Fouad Alkhatib) Shikaki polls NCAG Great Reset UNRWA DSA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-econtalk-加沙多数人已抛弃哈马斯-缴械窗口正在打开/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>加沙多数人已抛弃哈马斯，缴械窗口正在打开</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加沙出生的政策学者 Alkhatib 用四层反对、两份民调和人口数据论证：多数加沙人早已反哈马斯，哈马斯可能被迫阶段性缴械；但主持人 Russ 的悲观提醒，缴械对哈马斯等于政治自杀。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">加沙</span><span class=\"tag\">哈马斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Gavin Baker: Why AI Demand Is Outrunning Compute Supply Neocloud RVG ZDR EV to net PP&amp;E Jalapeno\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-a16z-ai-不是供给过剩-是严重供给不足/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不是供给过剩，是严重供给不足</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所有人都在担心 AI 数据中心建太多，Gavin Baker 的结论相反：到 2028 年真正的问题是严重供给不足，算力价格可能不降反升。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Richmond Fed’s Tom Barkin on the Surprisingly Resilient Real Economy SEP dot plot R-star forward guidance private label\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-oddlots-美国经济韧性来自消费者向未来借钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">31:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>美国经济韧性来自消费者向未来借钱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Barkin拆解了消费为何在高物价下依然强劲：消费者降低储蓄、拖欠账单、延期还贷来维持支出；AI投资目前更多是涨价和挤出，而非生产率红利；美联储或需长期逆风。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费韧性</span><span class=\"tag\">美联储</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Bessent&#x27;s Wager and Why the World is Calling America&#x27;s Bluff | Henry Farrell Pascal&#x27;s wager weaponized interdependence flexible realism unitary executive neo-royalism busted flush\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-hiddenforces-美国财长用神罚威胁盟国-反而证明手里没牌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b4203c8f6331570-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">51:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Forces</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>美国财长用神罚威胁盟国，反而证明手里没牌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美财长 Bessent 把美国描写成易怒的神，要盟国像信帕斯卡赌局一样臣服。Farrell 看穿这篇社论：威胁越响亮，越证明美国没有兑现手段，盟国已经开始自保。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">贸易战</span><span class=\"tag\">美元体系</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep. 399: Dan Dennett&#x27;s Model of Mind (Part One) Cartesian Theater Multiple Drafts Model Phi phenomenon Qualia Homunculus Stalinesque vs. Orwellian\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-pel-笛卡尔剧场不存在-意识不是放映-而是多重草稿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5a66360fe1170966-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">47:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Partially Examined Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>意识没有终点线：大脑是多重草稿，不是放映厅</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dennett 反对「笛卡尔剧场」：没有单一终点线让所有感觉汇入意识；大脑是并行判别、互不汇总的多重草稿，连「你什么时候意识到」都常常没有事实答案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">意识</span><span class=\"tag\">哲学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"漫长的告别：失智症、照护者与终将老去的我们 Hogeweyk The Soul of Care informal care long-term care insurance wet-on-wet watercolor\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-cn300980-失智照护的难不在失智老人-而在会被拖垮的照护者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda8c0f9bba83da6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"不\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">不合时宜</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>失智照护的难不在失智老人，而在会被拖垮的照护者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">失智照护的难不在老人病情本身，而在被日复一日拖垮的照护者——照护把妻子变成护士、让90后辞职，爱是起点却不是支撑，制度还没接住这些家庭。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">失智症</span><span class=\"tag\">老年照护</span>\n</div></div></a>"]